  "description": "Staying behind late at night to tidy up, Yo-Ham discovers a maid outfit among the belongings. Unable to resist a secret desire, he hid inside the cabinet and crossed the line... Just then, peering through the crack in the door, was Ju Eui-Yeong, whom he had always watched from afar. Of all people, he gets caught at the very moment he least wanted to be seen. \n\n*“Senior, you’re even worse than I am, aren’t you?”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
